{"metadata":{"title":"setUser:emails:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:emails:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setUser:emails:"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setUser:emails:"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setUser:emails:"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setUser:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"userId","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"emails:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray","text":"NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"emails","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The custom user identifier."}]}],"name":"userId"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Array of email address strings to associate with the user.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"emails"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Convenience method that combines "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setEmails:"},{"type":"text","text":" into a single"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server request. This is more efficient than calling both methods separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and ensures atomic association of user ID with emails."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this during login or registration flows when you have both user ID","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and email available simultaneously."}]},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Complete registration with user ID and emails:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class RegistrationManager {","","    func completeRegistration(_ registration: RegistrationData) {","        \/\/ Create user on backend","        APIClient.shared.createUser(registration) { result in","            guard case .success(let user) = result else { return }","","            \/\/ Set both user ID and emails in single operation","            var emails = [user.email]","            if let secondaryEmail = registration.secondaryEmail {","                emails.append(secondaryEmail)","            }","","            Pushwoosh.configure.setUser(user.id, emails: emails)","","            \/\/ Set initial user tags","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                \"registration_date\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date()),","                \"registration_source\": registration.source.rawValue,","                \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","                \"has_completed_onboarding\": false","            ])","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["   when you need confirmation."]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets user identifier and emails together in a single operation."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setuser:emails:"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.Pushwoosh